.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:19:## Insight
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:20:Claude Code now provides 12+ hook lifecycle events. The relevant ones for subagent telemetry are:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:22:| Event | Triggers when | Available for shell command hooks (.claude/settings.json)? |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:23:|---|---|---|
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:24:| `PreToolUse` | A tool call is about to fire | Yes |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:25:| `PostToolUse` | A tool call succeeded | Yes |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:26:| `PostToolUseFailure` | A tool call failed | Yes |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:27:| `SubagentStart` | Subagent initialization | SDK only (Python + TypeScript) |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:28:| `SubagentStop` | Subagent completion | SDK only — Stop hooks are automatically converted to SubagentStop when running inside a subagent |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:29:| `SessionStart` | Session initialization | TypeScript SDK or `.claude/settings.json` shell command |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:30:| `SessionEnd` | Session termination | TypeScript SDK or `.claude/settings.json` shell command (Python SDK lacks this) |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:32:PostToolUse + the matcher pattern `"Task"` is the shell-command-hook-compatible path for "fire after every Agent spawn." `SubagentStop` is a richer event but is SDK-only, which means it requires running gobbi through the agent SDK rather than the standalone Claude Code CLI — a heavier integration than the current `.claude/settings.json` `hooks.*` configuration model.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:34:A v2.1.119 addition: `PostToolUse` and `PostToolUseFailure` hook inputs now include `duration_ms` — tool execution time excluding permission prompts and PreToolUse hook execution.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:36:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:38:- `claude-code-posttooluse-hook-schema.md` (the companion reference with the full PostToolUse / PostToolUseFailure input schema)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:39:- `checklists/cross-layer-drift-gate.md` (the drift gate that keeps hook registration aligned across `.claude/settings.json`, skills, and the session schema)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:40:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:41:## Why it applies
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:42:The subagent-telemetry hook design picks PostToolUse + matcher `"Task"` as its mechanism. This reference establishes:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:43:1. PostToolUse is the **shell-command-compatible** event for subagent completion telemetry — consistent with the existing `session-start.sh` shell-script precedent.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:44:2. SubagentStop is a richer alternative but requires SDK integration that gobbi does not currently use — out of scope.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:45:3. PostToolUse has matured (v2.1.119 added `duration_ms`) — the schema is in active evolution, so the hook script should be defensive about field availability.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:46:4. `PostToolUseFailure` is the parallel event for failed tool calls — the hook design should consider whether failed subagent spawns also populate `agents[]` (probably yes, with a `status` field reflecting failure).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:47:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:48:## Source
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:49:- https://claudefa.st/blog/tools/hooks/hooks-guide
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:50:- https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks (referenced)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:51:- Both accessed 2026-05-23
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:52:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:53:## Excerpt
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:54:> "PostToolUse duration (v2.1.119): PostToolUse and PostToolUseFailure hook inputs now include duration_ms — tool execution time in milliseconds, excluding time spent in permission prompts and PreToolUse hook execution, available on both PostToolUse and PostToolUseFailure hooks."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:55:> "For subagents, Stop hooks are automatically converted to SubagentStop since that is the event that fires when a subagent completes."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:56:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:57:## Usage history
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/references/claude-code-hooks-12-lifecycle-events.md:58:
