.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:15:# Feature: Guardrails
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:17:The 13 Iron Laws plus the mistake-capture-and-learn loop that keep agents in scope, verifying claims, and not repeating known traps. This is one of the 7 capability value-features the memory-system redesign ratified (memory-system-redesign design doc §1.2). Iron Law #13 (no document work without a spec and a CRUD plan) is the principle this feature most recently added.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:19:## Overview
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:21:`guardrails` unites gobbi's behavioral floor (the Iron Laws) with its learning loop (mistake capture and two-layer promotion): together they keep agents inside scope, verifying before claiming done, and not repeating known traps across sessions.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:23:## Status
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:25:Active. The behavioral floor (13 Iron Laws in the `principles` skill) and the mistake-capture loop (the `mistake` skill plus the `mistakes/` tier) are both live. The feature directory itself was created during the memory-system redesign when work-sprint artifacts were re-homed into the 7 capability value-features; durable guardrails artifacts (cross-layer drift gating and hook-event documentation references) now live under this directory's subdirectories.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:27:## Subsystems
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:29:- `principles` (the 13 Iron Laws, incl. new #13)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:30:- `mistake` (moment-of-capture, two-layer promotion, required-mistakes wiring) + the `mistakes/` tier as consumer
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:32:## Subdirectories
