.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:35:- `changelogs/` — what shipped per task
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:36:- `checklists/` — implementation checklists the design must address per scenario
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:37:- `discussions/` — substantive AskUserQuestion topics scoped to guardrails
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/README.md:38:- `references/` — external prior art touching principles / mistakes
