.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:3:description: User decision — hook + reconstructor tasks use Iron Law 7 mistake only (not the full 3-mistake bundle used for setup tasks).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:6:feature: guardrails
