.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:9:session: 1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:10:tags: [mistake-bundle, task-briefs, iron-law-7, planning-lock]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:11:outcome: Iron Law 7 procedural mistake only for hook + reconstructor tasks (LOCK #3); the other 2 mistakes from the setup-task bundle are inapplicable
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:12:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:13:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:14:# Mistake bundle extension to hook + reconstructor tasks
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:15:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:16:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:18:The guardrails Planning preparation mandated a 3-mistake bundle for all infrastructure setup task briefs. The leader asked whether the same bundle should extend to hook + reconstructor tasks (the group implementing the PostToolUse hook script, the reconstructor shell script, `.claude/settings.json` registration, and delegation skill structured-header conventions), or whether only the Iron Law 7 procedural mistake applies.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:20:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:22:Should hook + reconstructor tasks receive the full 3-mistake setup-task bundle, or a narrower subset?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:24:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:26:1. **Full 3-mistake bundle for hook + reconstructor tasks** — consistent with setup tasks; all three mistakes always loaded.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:27:2. **Iron Law 7 mistake only for hook + reconstructor tasks** (recommended) — `manager-iter2-brief-failed-iron-law-7-verbatim-spec-recheck.md` applies; the other two (cwd routing, rm -rf safety) are inapplicable to these surfaces.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:29:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:31:The user confirmed: load only the Iron Law 7 procedural mistake for hook + reconstructor task briefs, narrowed from the leader's 3-mistake recommendation. This was locked as a Planning-phase decision.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:33:## Rationale
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:35:- `codex-eval-session-write-path-nested-in-worktree.md`: guards cwd routing for session writes. Hook + reconstructor tasks (hook script, reconstructor, settings.json, delegation headers) do not write to session paths. Inapplicable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:36:- `manager-rm-rf-without-investigating-tracked-files.md`: guards against destructive rm operations without investigation. Hook + reconstructor tasks do not remove files. Inapplicable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:37:- `manager-iter2-brief-failed-iron-law-7-verbatim-spec-recheck.md`: guards against paraphrasing "verbatim" spec content without re-reading. Hook + reconstructor tasks involve verbatim citation of hook stdin contract, structured-header regexes, and JSON schema field names. Directly applicable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:39:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:40:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:41:Setup task briefs (infrastructure setup group): all three mistakes in their tier-4 load list. Hook + reconstructor task briefs: Iron Law 7 mistake only in tier-4. Per-task additions allowed on top of this baseline.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:42:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:43:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:44:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:45:- This decision was locked in the guardrails Planning phase as part of the agent-assignment rationale (provenance in that session's Planning artifacts).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/discussions/2026-05-24-mistake-bundle-extension-to-t3.md:46:- It narrows the 3-mistake load directive that the infrastructure-setup task briefs carry; the hook + reconstructor briefs load only the Iron Law 7 mistake.
