.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:15:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:17:# Goodhart risk: agents[] population metric becomes target when demanded
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:19:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:21:Risk identified during guardrails Ideation: if the project starts treating `agents[]` population rate as a metric, teams may game it by providing trivial or near-empty entries. The design does not add any gate that enforces quality of the populated fields — it only enforces presence.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:23:## Why deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:25:Deferred from the hook + reconstructor Ideation scope. The hook + reconstructor satisfy the literal ask (populate `agents[]`). Field-quality gates are a future extension.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:27:The hook + reconstructor session's success criterion was "≥ 90% population (12 fields × N entries)" — this is a presence threshold, not a quality threshold. Quality gates (e.g., non-null `step/phase/iter`) are downstream of field presence; they require a schema validator which was itself deferred as a separate work item.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:29:## When to pick up
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:31:When the project decides to enforce `agents[]` field quality rather than mere presence — for example, when a schema validator for session.json is added.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:33:## Suggested approach
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:35:- Add a schema validator gate that checks non-null values on critical `agents[]` fields (`step`, `phase`, `iter`).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:36:- Accept the risk for now: the presence gate is already useful and the Goodhart failure mode requires deliberate gaming.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:37:- A future session adding `agents[]` quality validation should reference this item as the motivating concern.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:39:## Originating session
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:40:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:41:`.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-23-1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac/` — originated in the guardrails Ideation of that session.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:42:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:43:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/goodhart-factor-when-demanded-deferred.md:44:
