.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:17:# Assume PostToolUseFailure verbatim quote was correctly retrieved via WebFetch
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:19:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:21:During guardrails Ideation, the session leader ran WebFetch of `https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks` and preserved verbatim quotes: lifecycle-table `| PostToolUseFailure | After a tool call fails |` and exit-code-behavior `| PostToolUseFailure | No | Shows stderr to Claude (tool already failed) |`. The leader cited 31 hook events on the page; a Codex evaluator independently fetched the URL and confirmed PostToolUseFailure exists, though the actual enumerable count was 29.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:23:The Claude evaluator's sandbox did not include WebFetch tooling, so independent re-verification of the verbatim quotes was not possible at Ideation evaluation. The Codex evaluator independently verified the event exists and is supported via command hooks.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:25:## Why deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:27:Accepted at Ideation exit per the brief's escape-hatch: Confidence-50 downgrade authorized when independent WebFetch is unavailable. The verbatim quotes are preserved in `features/guardrails/references/claude-code-posttooluse-hook-schema.md`. Deferred empirical re-verification to Execution time when the executor authors `.claude/settings.json` PostToolUseFailure hook registration.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:29:If the hook registration fails at runtime, the failure is loud and immediate; the reconstructor remains the recovery mechanism for failed-spawn audit trail.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:31:## When to pick up
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:33:When authoring `.claude/settings.json` hook registration for PostToolUseFailure. At that time, test the registration empirically.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:35:## Suggested approach
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:37:- Author the PostToolUseFailure registration in `.claude/settings.json`.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:38:- Run Claude Code and verify the hook fires on a tool call failure.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:39:- If the event name is wrong, Claude Code will silently no-op the registration or error at startup — both are detectable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:40:- Fallback: collapse to PostToolUse-only if runtime registration fails.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/guardrails/backlogs/posttooluse-failure-webfetch-verification-gap.md:42:## Originating session
