.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:11:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:12:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:13:# Ideation evaluation PASS — Ideation loop closed
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:15:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:17:The final Ideation evaluation produced PASS from both systems — Claude (all 8 perspectives) and Codex (all 8 perspectives), a dual-system PASS. This was the last iteration allowed under the 3-iteration evaluation budget. Several non-blocking findings remained open at PASS time:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:19:- Hook-event count discrepancy (31 counted vs 29 expected in docs) — docs-sync, non-blocking
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:20:- `chore` label line citation off by 2 — docs-sync, Low, non-blocking
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:21:- WebFetch verification gap for the `PostToolUseFailure` hook event — assumption_risk, deferred to Execution
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:22:- Hook-silence diagnostic scenario — deferred scenario_gap
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:23:- Cross-layer drift gate — checklist_gap, open
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:24:- Privacy / retention concern — deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:25:- Sidecar lock refinement — deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:27:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:29:Given a dual-system PASS at the final budgeted iteration, with only Medium/Low findings still open, should the Ideation loop be closed and the session advanced to Preparation, or held open to clear the residual findings first?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:31:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:33:- **Close the loop on PASS, carry residual findings forward** — accept the dual-system PASS, advance to Preparation, and route the open Medium/Low findings to Execution / backlog.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:34:- **Hold the loop open to clear residual findings** — keep iterating, but the 3-iteration budget was already exhausted, so this would mean spending budget that no longer existed.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:36:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:38:Close the Ideation loop on the dual-system PASS. No Critical or High findings remained open, so PASS is defensible per the verdict rules; the residual Medium/Low findings are carried forward (deferred to Execution or backlog) rather than blocking loop closure.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:39:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:40:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:42:The Ideation loop closed and the session advanced to Preparation, carrying forward the 11 design staging files and 17 discussion staging files produced during Ideation. The deferred findings (notably the `PostToolUseFailure` WebFetch verification) become Execution-phase obligations.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:43:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:44:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:45:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/eval-pass-loop-closed.md:46:- [`discussions/eval-fail-revise-escalation.md`](eval-fail-revise-escalation.md) — the prior FAIL iteration whose 3-fix revision led into this PASS.
