.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:39:The discrepancy is purely a filter-choice artifact: the loose filter counts a backlog file under the
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:40:excluded `agents/` surface, the strict P_live filter does not. The FIX-1 predicate and the leak-file
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:41:set reproduce identically under the canonical filter regardless of which sub-count is cited, so the
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:42:cross-foot is cosmetic, not a baseline error.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:43:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:44:## Alternatives considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:45:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:46:Pick the loose filter (28) as canonical — rejected: the strict P_live filter is the predicate the
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:47:conformance gate actually uses, so the canonical sub-count must match it (27) to avoid a second drift.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:48:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:49:## Consequences
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:50:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:51:- No change to the FIX-1 predicate, the key-set S, or the leak-file target.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/fix1-subcounts-cross-foot-cosmetic.md:52:- Execution implementation must use one consistent filter throughout.
