.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/decisions/pre-planning-readiness-decisions.md:3:description: Decisions log for the Preparation Loop evaluation cycle — env-var-audit + SessionStart hook; three evaluation findings resolved across two iterations.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/decisions/pre-planning-readiness-decisions.md:4:type: decisions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/decisions/pre-planning-readiness-decisions.md:5:scope: feature
