.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:2:name: codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:3:description: Codex Planning evaluator false-passed due to relative paths resolving to a prior session directory — re-dispatched with absolute paths and marker verification.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:6:feature: evaluation
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:7:status: active
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:8:created: 2026-05-24
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:9:session: 1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:10:tags: [codex, evaluation, relative-paths, re-dispatch]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:11:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:12:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:13:# Codex evaluation blocked by stale-session paths — re-dispatched with strict brief
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:15:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:17:During the Planning loop's second evaluation iteration, the Codex evaluator was first dispatched with a wrapper that used relative ellipsis paths (`sessions/.../planning/...`). Codex's sandbox resolved those relative paths against a prior session's directory (`2026-05-23-7ea62d36-...`) rather than the current one. The evaluator wrote to the wrong session directory and validated against stale files, reporting a false PASS.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:19:The Claude evaluator independently re-ran Codex's claimed empirical checks and found they referenced artifacts from the prior session, not the current draft under evaluation — exposing the false PASS.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:21:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:23:How should the Codex evaluator be re-dispatched so it provably operates on the correct (current) session directory?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:25:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:27:1. **Re-dispatch with absolute paths + marker verification** — the wrapper specifies every path as absolute, writes a `.wrapper-marker` file before invocation, instructs Codex to verify that marker and write a `.codex-marker` file as its first action, and the validate step checks the marker exists after completion.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:28:2. **Accept the false PASS and proceed Claude-only** — use the Claude evaluator's results for this iteration and treat Codex as optional.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:30:## User decision
