.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/evaluation/discussions/2026-05-24-codex-iter2-blocked-aggregation.md:32:Re-dispatch with absolute paths + marker verification. A genuine Codex PASS was required for the dual-system aggregate to PASS — a Claude-only result was not accepted.
