.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:2:name: underscore-staging-keys-false-clean
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:3:description: "Design flaw: hyphen-only leak gate falsely certifies underscore-spelled staging keys as clean; key-set S must include both hyphen and underscore spellings."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:4:tags: [leak-gate, staging-keys, underscore, conformance]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:5:created: 2026-05-26
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:6:session: b0a0eaf9-03f7-4dce-a040-c7443653a459
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:7:type: decisions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:8:domain: docs-sync
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/underscore-staging-keys-false-clean.md:9:status: accepted
