.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:16:# `disposition` preservation verification on backlog-touching conformance tasks — implementation checklist
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:18:| # | Item | Anchor | Status | Verification |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:19:|---|---|---|---|---|
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:20:| 1 | A conformance task that touches a feature dir containing `backlogs/` must assert `disposition` is preserved on each backlog file | type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak | implemented | After edits, each backlog file still carries its original `disposition:` value; the verify gate names the check explicitly rather than inferring it from the leak gate |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:21:| 2 | The `features/agents` conformance task asserts `disposition` preserved on its 1 backlog file | novel | implemented | `disposition` present on `features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md` after the strip |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:22:| 3 | The `features/guardrails` conformance task asserts `disposition` preserved on all 3 of its backlog files | novel | implemented | `disposition` present on the 3 guardrails backlog files after the strip |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:24:## Item details
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:26:### 1. Backlog-touching conformance tasks must assert disposition preservation
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:28:The original verify gates checked only: leak count = 0, the 9 base keys present, and git-diff scope. None asserted `disposition` preservation. A blanket strip could therefore pass "0 leaks + 9 base keys" while silently deleting a legitimate `disposition` key from a backlog file — `disposition: open|deferred` is a legitimate per-type extension on `backlogs/` and is explicitly out of scope for the staging-key strip.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:30:**Anchor reasoning:** anchored to the [type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak](../decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md) decision, which establishes that `disposition` is preserved on `backlogs/` and only stripped elsewhere.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:32:**Verification approach:** enumerate the backlog files in the feature dir before edits; after edits, confirm each still carries its original `disposition:` value; the verify gate must name this check explicitly.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:34:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:36:- [type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak](../decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md) — the decision establishing `disposition` is a legitimate backlog extension, not a leak
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/checklists/disposition-preservation-missing-t1-t5.md:37:- [`memorization/rules.md` §4.4](../../../skills/memorization/rules.md) — the conditional-`disposition` rule (leak everywhere except `backlogs/`)
