.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/scenarios/tier-2-3-scope-explicitly-placed.md:21:The user ratified a 3-tier scope in discussion-log Q4: (1) standard + content rewrite [primary],
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/scenarios/tier-2-3-scope-explicitly-placed.md:22:(2) skills/principles [optional], (3) organization & navigation. An early Scope Contract only
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/scenarios/tier-2-3-scope-explicitly-placed.md:23:enumerated tier-1 items and hand-waved that lower tiers were "folded into the in-scope waves."
