.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:14:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:15:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:16:# Entrypoint doc must be cited as `.claude/CLAUDE.md`, not bare `CLAUDE.md`
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:18:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:20:A path-precision concern was raised against the readiness work: the entrypoint document was cited as `CLAUDE.md:60` when the correct path is `.claude/CLAUDE.md:60`. There is no root-level `CLAUDE.md` in this repository — the file lives under `.claude/`, so the bare-path citation would not resolve for a future reader.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:22:The proposed fix was to correct the path before the related backlog was promoted to project memory.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:24:## Decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:26:The imprecise citation was resolved by removing the artifact that carried it: the redundant staged backlog tracking the dangling claude-skill link was dropped as a triplicate (see [triplicate-backlog-remediated](triplicate-backlog-remediated.md)). No surviving record carries the bad path. The remaining authoritative backlogs (the HIGH and MEDIUM dangling-link records) are committed files this work did not mutate, so their citations stand as-is.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:28:## Rationale
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:30:There was no live record left to correct: the only artifact carrying `CLAUDE.md:60` was the triplicate backlog, and that was removed for a separate reason (atomicity). Editing source rawdata after the fact is forbidden by the read-only-rawdata constraint, so the correct path is recorded here as the durable note instead.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:32:## Alternatives considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:34:Edit the path inline in the originating draft — rejected: that draft is read-only audit rawdata and must not be mutated after the fact. Recording the corrected path in this decision is the durable substitute.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:36:## Consequences
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:38:Future work that re-opens the dangling-link tracking must cite the entrypoint as `.claude/CLAUDE.md`, never bare `CLAUDE.md`. No outstanding correction action remains for this session.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:39:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:40:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:42:- [triplicate-backlog-remediated](triplicate-backlog-remediated.md) — the removal of the artifact that carried the imprecise path
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:43:- [`.claude/CLAUDE.md`](../../../../../../.claude/CLAUDE.md) — the entrypoint document whose canonical path this decision pins
