.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:17:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:19:An early ideation draft scoped the conformance wave to "strip the 64 staging-key leaks"
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:20:including `disposition`. This was unsafe as written: `disposition: open|deferred` is a
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:21:**legitimate extension field on `backlogs/` docs** (`rules.md` §2.2 line 110), and the
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:22:stripping rule qualifies `disposition` as staging-only "when used purely as eval routing"
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:23:(`rules.md` §2.3 line 122) — NOT on backlogs. A naive grep-strip would corrupt backlog
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:24:lifecycle semantics.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:26:## Decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:28:The conformance wave uses a **type-aware allowlist strip (FIX-1)** — NOT a blanket grep.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:30:- **Illegitimate key-set S:** `{ finding-id, confidence, severity, surfaced-by, promoted-from,
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:31:  promoted-at, mistake-candidate }` + `disposition` ONLY when the file is NOT under a
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/type-aware-strip-disposition-not-blanket-leak.md:32:  `backlogs/` directory.
