.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:3:description: "Design for adding a Moment-of-Capture Core Principle to memorization/SKILL.md, enforcing write-as-you-go during WORK"
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:4:type: design
