.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:15:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:17:# Memorization moment-of-capture Core Principle
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:19:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:21:The write-as-you-go discipline gap lives in WORK: corrections, decisions, and mistake-candidates that surface during a loop's DISCUSSION are often deferred to the MEMORIZATION sub-phase and then silently lost when a session is interrupted. The corrective documentation, however, lives in MEMORIZATION's contract, so the discipline needs a home that every agent loading memorization will see.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:23:Scope is deliberately narrow: in-scope is adding one Core Principle bullet to the memorization skill plus a reciprocal link to the mistake skill's P2. Out-of-scope is changing the MEMORIZATION procedure steps or the staging routing.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:25:## Approach
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:27:Add a new Core Principle bullet, "Moment-of-capture, not end-of-loop," to the memorization skill's Core Principles section — placed after "Store what survives, not what's transient" and before "Templates over freeform." The body states in two or three sentences that corrections / decisions / mistake-candidates are written to staging or rawdata at the moment of occurrence during WORK, not deferred to MEMORIZATION. Add a reciprocal link to the mistake skill's P2, which already says "Do not defer to MEMORIZATION" — the two-way link closes the loop between the two skills.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:29:## Rationale
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:31:The discipline must appear wherever memorization is loaded, so every agent encounters it at the point of capture rather than only after a loop completes. Placing the bullet inside the memorization skill's Core Principles guarantees that visibility, and the reciprocal link to the mistake skill's P2 keeps the two statements of intent mutually discoverable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:33:The change is verifiable by two checks confirming both halves landed:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:34:- `grep -i "moment-of-capture" memorization/SKILL.md` returns at least one match.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:35:- `grep "memorization/SKILL.md" mistake/SKILL.md` returns the reciprocal link.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:37:## Alternatives considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:39:- **Stating the discipline only in the mistake skill's P2** — rejected: a correction surfaces during MEMORIZATION's contract, so an agent loading memorization (but not re-reading the mistake skill) would miss it. The principle needs a home in the memorization skill itself.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:40:- **Changing the MEMORIZATION procedure steps or staging routing** — rejected as out-of-scope: the gap is a visibility/discipline gap, not a routing gap, and the additive Core Principle bullet closes it without procedure surgery.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:42:## Consequences
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:43:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:44:The discipline becomes visible wherever memorization is loaded, at the cost of a small duplication of intent between the memorization Core Principle and the mistake skill's P2. The duplication is accepted because the reciprocal link keeps the two statements in sync. Both the principle bullet and the reciprocal link are purely additive — there are no remaining open issues or follow-ups.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:45:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:46:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:47:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:48:- [`skills/memorization/SKILL.md`](../../../skills/memorization/SKILL.md) — the skill the Core Principle bullet was added to
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:49:- [`skills/mistake/SKILL.md`](../../../skills/mistake/SKILL.md) — the P2 the new bullet reciprocally links to
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/design/memorization-moment-of-capture.md:50:</content>
