.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:15:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:16:# "Unrelated to retrofit" independence claim was overstated — but the defer still stands
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:18:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:20:The Preparation readiness work characterized the dangling `[claude skill](skills/claude/SKILL.md)` link as "out-of-scope `.claude/`-surface drift unrelated to the memory-doc retrofit."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:22:A Project-perspective evaluation found this independence claim overstated: the gobbi entry-point skill (`skills/gobbi/SKILL.md`, the FLAG-2 row) states the missing `claude` skill's intended home is the `project-memory` value-feature — the exact feature this session retrofits, under Principle 13 (No Document Work Without a Spec) that governs the doc-work.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:24:The coupling exists (same feature, same P13). The draft framing understated it by calling it "unrelated."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:26:## Decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:28:The defer decision is USER-RATIFIED and stands (explicit avoid-unnecessary-change steer, no skill generated this loop). No re-ideate. The characterization is recorded here as an open annotation — the independence claim was imprecise but the defer is safe and correct.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:30:## Rationale
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:32:The defer is correct regardless of the coupling: the memory-doc retrofit itself does not depend on a `.claude/`-authoring skill (independently confirmed by both Claude and Codex evaluators — the hot path is `memorization/rules.md` + `memory-map.md` + `templates/*` + P13 directly). The "unrelated" phrasing was imprecise but did not affect the readiness conclusion.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:34:For future sessions: the correct characterization is "project-memory-feature-adjacent drift, deferred per user's avoid-unnecessary-change steer" — not "unrelated."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:36:## Alternatives considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:38:- Re-characterize inline in the draft — not done (post-EVALUATION mutation; the rawdata draft is preserved as-is).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:39:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:40:## Consequences
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:42:- FLAG-2 (HIGH, open) remains the canonical record; its HIGH classification should stand.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:43:- A future session should update the characterization if re-opening the dangling-link item.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:44:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/coupling-mischaracterization-deferred.md:45:## Related
