.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:18:After locking the three-tier scope, the leader proposed a conformance-first sequencing to de-risk
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:19:the large retrofit: do the mechanical, verifiable frontmatter normalization before the subjective
