.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:24:Accept the conformance-first reframe / prose-first / standard-only.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:26:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:28:- **Conformance-first (recommended):** write the standard → mechanical conformance wave (frontmatter
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:29:  normalization + staging-key strip + body de-crypt) → prose-quality wave. Each wave verifiable.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:30:- **Prose-first:** start with prose rewrite immediately. Risk: harder to verify progress; mixes
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:31:  structural and quality changes.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:32:- **Standard-only:** write the standard but defer all retrofit. Risk: standard exists but no docs
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-conformance-first-then-prose.md:33:  conform to it.
