.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:20:## Insight
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:21:Treat docs like code: a mechanical lint/CI gate catches structural defects (schema, broken links, staleness tied to git "last updated"), while human (or agent) review is reserved for the judgment that machines cannot make — prose quality and content correctness. Split the cheap mechanical check from the expensive judgment check.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:23:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:25:- [frontmatter-as-schema](frontmatter-as-schema.md) — the schema this lint gate enforces mechanically
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:26:- [`memorization/rules.md` §4.5](../../../skills/memorization/rules.md) — the gobbi leak gate this docs-as-code split informed
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:28:## Why it applies
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:29:Informs the self-enforcement tier. A mechanical frontmatter/section conformance check — extend gobbi's existing Final-Gate grep to `features/` — catches schema and staging-key-leak violations cheaply (the minimal grep gate, Locked Decision 4 / D8). The prose-quality / type-purity bar stays a judgment check; encoding it as a dedicated evaluation perspective is the heavier enforcement the user deferred. Invoke when shaping the minimal grep gate and the Deferred backlog.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:31:## Source
