.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:33:- https://buildwithfern.com/post/docs-linting-guide
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/docs-as-code-linting.md:34:- https://fiberplane.com/blog/drift-documentation-linter/
