.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:16:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:18:The Ideation leader surfaced the scope choice: should the session cover just the standard +
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:19:content rewrite, or also the skills/principles encoding, or also organization & navigation?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:21:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:23:Primary scope among: (1) standard + content rewrite, (2) organization & navigation,
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:24:(3) skills/principles encoding.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:26:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:28:- **Option A:** standard + content rewrite only (primary deliverable, minimal scope).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:29:- **Option B:** standard + all three tiers in one session (ambitious, risk of big-bang).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:30:- **Option C:** cover all three, with stated priority order (bottom-up, each tier verified).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:32:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:34:"Cover all three; priority = (1) Standard + content rewrite [primary], (2) skills/principles
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:35:[optional, not mandatory], (3) organization & navigation."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:37:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:39:All three tiers are In-Scope. Priority order:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:40:- Tier 1 (primary): standard authoring + conformance wave + prose-quality wave — must ship.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:41:- Tier 2 (optional): minimal mechanical grep gate extended to `features/`; no Principle-13
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:42:  surgery or new eval perspective (deferred).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:43:- Tier 3 (tertiary): light nav wave verifying feature README.md Subdirectories sections; runs
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/discussions/2026-05-26-scope-spine-three-tier-priority.md:44:  last, must not block tier-1.
