.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:18:# ADR — Context/Decision/Consequences as the canonical decision-doc shape
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:20:## Insight
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:21:The Nygard ADR template — Title / Status / Context / Decision / Consequences — is the canonical shape for a decision document. The most under-used section is **Consequences "including the negative ones, not just positive."**
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/adr-decision-record-shape.md:23:## Related
