.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:18:# Frontmatter as document schema — conformance enables filter-before-read
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:20:## Insight
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:21:Frontmatter acts as type signatures for documents; a consistent schema (including fields like `lastUpdated`) lets a consumer filter and detect staleness *without reading the body*. The conformance of the schema matters as much as the schema's existence.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:23:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:25:- [docs-as-code-linting](docs-as-code-linting.md) — the mechanical gate that enforces this schema conformance
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:26:- [markdown-memory-atomicity](markdown-memory-atomicity.md) — the atomic-markdown memory architecture the schema rides on
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:28:## Why it applies
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:29:This validates gobbi's base-frontmatter bet (machine-addressable memory): an agent should filter on frontmatter before loading bodies. It justifies Success Criterion 2 (100% base-schema conformance on live docs, 0 staging-key leaks outside `archive/`) as a real retrieval win rather than pedantry — the ~15%-realized base schema is what blocks the filter-before-read pattern today. Invoke when stating the frontmatter conformance target (D6) and sizing the conformance wave.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:31:## Source
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:32:- https://understandingdata.com/posts/frontmatter-as-document-schema/
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:34:## Excerpt
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:35:"Frontmatter is effectively a schema for your documents — and a schema is only useful if documents conform to it."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/references/frontmatter-as-schema.md:36:
