.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-iter2-fix-direction-continue-this-session.md:19:The first Planning evaluation iteration returned REVISE with 5 High findings. The leader asked the user to confirm the direction for the fix: address all 5 findings surgically within this session's planning loop, or defer to a next session as a fresh Planning iteration.
