.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-iter2-fix-direction-continue-this-session.md:27:1. **Continue this session — surgical 5-fix pass** — the fix iteration is strictly a delta on the prior draft: update exactly the 5 declared sections, copy all other sections verbatim. No re-architecture. Faster path to Execution.
