.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:12:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:13:# Bundle scope confirmation — worktree-first + agents[] hook in scope; skill-loading deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:15:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:17:The session opened with four candidate work items competing for scope: worktree-first session architecture, a skill-loading-discipline matrix, an agents[] PostToolUse hook, and a new promote-now commit-on-branch addition. Plus two adjacent ideas (auto-mode silence, chat-mode redesign) and a Codex CI integration. The session needed an explicit scope lock before Planning could proceed.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:19:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:21:Which of the candidate items should be in scope for this session?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:23:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:25:The candidates on the table:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:26:- **Worktree-first session architecture** — the core proposal; the others depend on or relate to it.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:27:- **Promote-now commit-on-branch (NEW)** — a small addition that depends on worktree-first.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:28:- **agents[] PostToolUse hook + reconstructor** — independent feature work.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:29:- **Skill-loading-discipline matrix + Load-Directives validator** — flagged by the user as "looks ambiguous."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:30:- **Codex CI integration**, **auto-mode silence vs always-ask**, **chat-mode tiki-taka redesign** — adjacent ideas.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:32:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:34:Scope locked to two Execution deliverables:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:35:- **Worktree-first session architecture**, with the **promote-now commit-on-branch** addition absorbed into it — in scope.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:36:- **agents[] PostToolUse hook + reconstructor** — in scope.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:38:Deferred / out of scope:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:39:- **Skill-loading-discipline matrix + Load-Directives validator** — deferred entirely (the user found it ambiguous).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:40:- **Codex CI integration** — deferred.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:41:- **auto-mode silence vs always-ask** and **chat-mode tiki-taka redesign** — out of scope.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:42:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:43:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:44:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:45:Two Execution tasks ship this session: worktree-first (with promote-now absorbed) and the agents[] hook. All deferred items are backlogged for future sessions.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/bundle-scope-confirmation.md:46:
