.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/references/langgraph-skill-catalog-pattern.md:11:title: LangGraph deep-agents skills catalog — domain knowledge outside the prompt
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/references/langgraph-skill-catalog-pattern.md:12:source: https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/deepagents/skills
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/references/langgraph-skill-catalog-pattern.md:13:accessed: 2026-05-23
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/references/langgraph-skill-catalog-pattern.md:14:ref_type: docs
