.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/design/tool-use-id-correlation-key.md:3:description: tool_use_id is the correlation key for matching hook stdin to transcript toolUseResult lines; always available in hook stdin and consistent for reconstructor walk.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/design/tool-use-id-correlation-key.md:4:type: design
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/design/tool-use-id-correlation-key.md:5:scope: feature
