.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-wave-ordering-sequential-t1-t3.md:3:description: User confirmed T1→T3 wave ordering is strict sequential (graph-enforced), not advisory — LOCK #1 applies as hard constraint.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-wave-ordering-sequential-t1-t3.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-wave-ordering-sequential-t1-t3.md:5:scope: feature
