.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:14:# Skill-loading matrix location ambiguity — T2 deferred from this session
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:15:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:16:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:18:During Ideation, a design question asked where the skill-loading matrix should live; the leader proposed `delegation/SKILL.md`. The proposal surfaced an ambiguity the user was not ready to resolve, which put the whole skill-loading-discipline topic (T2) in question for this session.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:20:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:22:Where should the skill-loading matrix live, and should the T2 skill-loading-discipline topic be settled this session?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:24:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:26:1. **Place the matrix in `delegation/SKILL.md` and design T2 this session** — the leader's proposed home for the matrix.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:27:2. **Defer T2 entirely** — the matrix location and the Load-Directives validator scope remain open for a future session.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:29:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:31:The user raised the concern "looks ambiguous" and deferred T2 entirely from this session. The post-Ideation scope is the T1 and T3 waves only.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:33:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:35:T2 is fully deferred. The T2 design (matrix location, Load-Directives validator scope) becomes a decision point for the future session that picks up the skill-loading-discipline backlog. The composite root-cause analysis and the literal-ask scope lock are preserved in that backlog for continuity.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/discussions/matrix-location-ambiguity-defers-t2.md:37:## Related
