.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:24:### 1. Branch regex check
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:26:**Why this check matters**: The worktree-create design adds a success criterion that after the worktree-creation step lands, new session branches follow the `chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}` pattern. This smoke test verifies the runtime materializes that branch correctly.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:28:**Verification approach**: `jq '.git.branch' session.json | grep -E '^chore/session-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[a-f0-9]{8}$'` on the first session after the worktree-create PR merge.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:30:### 2. worktreePath non-null
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:32:**Why this check matters**: The worktree-first design's success criterion is that `session.json.git.worktreePath` is non-null immediately after Configuration. A null value means the worktree-creation step was skipped or failed.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:34:### 3. generate-now PR diff
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:36:**Why this check matters**: The motivating failure that led to the worktree-first design was commit `1829fa3`, where Preparation generate-now symlinks created in the main tree missed the PR diff. This check is the structural regression test confirming the fix holds post-merge.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/migration-smoke-test-post-merge.md:38:## Related
