.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/backlogs/lock2-shared-executor-mega-task-risk.md:3:description: Tasks 07+08 shared-executor context-budget risk — deferred assumption
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/backlogs/lock2-shared-executor-mega-task-risk.md:4:type: backlogs
