.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/backlogs/lock2-shared-executor-mega-task-risk.md:10:tags: [execution, shared-executor, context-budget, lock2]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/backlogs/lock2-shared-executor-mega-task-risk.md:11:priority: medium
