.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/ci-symlink-backlog-pseudocode-plumbing.md:10:tags: [ci, symlink, git, pseudocode, backlog]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/ci-symlink-backlog-pseudocode-plumbing.md:11:disposition: open
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/ci-symlink-backlog-pseudocode-plumbing.md:12:supersedes: null
