.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/task01-t1c-trace-overclaim.md:21:| 1 | Task 01 `traces-to` must only include anchors whose actual implementation work happens in Task 01 | novel | pending | Review `traces-to` fields vs file-map assignments before finalizing any future plan revision |
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/task01-t1c-trace-overclaim.md:22:| 2 | Task heading must match the primary `traces-to` anchors (not drift to stale anchor names) | novel | pending | Cross-check heading vs `traces-to` on every plan task before PASS |
