.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:1:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:2:name: scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:3:description: User decision to scope the skill-loading matrix + Load-Directives validator to the literal ask rather than a broader delegation contract verifier; broader framing deferred to backlog.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:6:feature: agents
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:7:status: active
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:8:created: 2026-05-23
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:9:session: 1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:10:tags: [t2, scope, validator, delegation-contract]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:11:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:12:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:13:# Validator scope: literal-ask (skill-loading matrix + validator) vs broader delegation contract verifier
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:15:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:17:The proposed structural fix was a canonical role × phase × required-skills matrix plus a validator that checks each delegation prompt's Load Directives against it. The question was how wide to draw the scope: keep it to that literal ask, or broaden it into a generic verifier of the whole delegation contract.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:19:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:21:Should the validator be scoped to the literal ask (the skill-loading matrix + a Load-Directives validator), or broadened into a generic "delegation contract verifier"?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:23:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:25:1. **Literal-ask scope** — build only the skill-loading matrix and the Load-Directives validator that reads from it. Bounded, directly addresses the observed skill-omission failure.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:26:2. **Broader delegation-contract verifier** — a generic verifier checking the full delegation contract (not just Load Directives). Larger scope, more design surface, ambiguous boundaries.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:28:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:30:The user locked the **literal-ask scope**: the matrix plus the Load-Directives validator. The broader "delegation contract verifier" reframing was deferred to the project-level backlog entry `backlogs/broader-delegation-contract-verifier.md` for a future session to pick up.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:32:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:34:The matrix-plus-validator task was itself subsequently deferred for the session (judged too ambiguous to specify during the design round), so no implementation shipped this session. The locked literal-ask scope framing is preserved so that whenever the task is picked up, it starts from the bounded scope rather than re-litigating literal-ask vs broader-verifier.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:36:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/discussions/scope-literal-ask-vs-broader-verifier.md:38:- Backlog: `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/backlogs/broader-delegation-contract-verifier.md` (project-level — the broader-verifier reframing this discussion deferred).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/dq-anchor-readability.md:1:---
