.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/dq-anchor-readability.md:3:description: DQ-n anchors are defined in sub-step rawdata, not in canonical draft — checklist for Planning to resolve anchors before decomposing tasks.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/dq-anchor-readability.md:4:type: checklists
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/dq-anchor-readability.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/workflow/checklists/dq-anchor-readability.md:6:feature: workflow
