.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:10:tags: [privacy, retention, agents-metadata]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:11:disposition: deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:12:domain: privacy
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:13:privacy: true
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:14:supersedes: null
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:15:superseded_by: null
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:16:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:18:# Privacy/retention note for agents[] metadata not formally documented
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:20:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:22:The `agents[]` array persisted in `session.json` by the PostToolUse hook records, per spawned subagent: `id` (UUID), `name` (agent role), `type`, `step`, `phase`, `iter`, `model`, `system`, `transcriptPath` (a local filesystem path), `tokensUsed`, `startedAt`, and `finishedAt`. A Codex risk evaluation of this hook flagged that no formal privacy or retention policy is documented for this persisted data. This backlog entry tracks writing that policy.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:24:## Why deferred
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:26:The persisted fields are operational telemetry, not personally identifying information: there is no user content and no credentials. The `transcriptPath` points into `~/.claude/projects/...`, which is already under the user's local filesystem control. Because the data is obvious non-PII today, a formal privacy/retention policy (for example, auto-purge after N days or redaction on publish) is a separate design decision that was out of scope for the hook task, and was deferred rather than blocking the ship.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:28:## When to pick up
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:30:Before any `session.json` data leaves the local filesystem — for example, if a future analytics or sharing feature transmits or publishes session telemetry. At that point a formal privacy review should be run, referencing this entry, and a retention/redaction policy decided.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:32:## Suggested approach
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:34:Add a brief privacy/retention note to `session.template.json` (low effort) documenting that `agents[]` is local-only operational telemetry, and define the retention rule (keep / auto-purge after N days) plus any redaction required before the data leaves the local filesystem.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:36:## Originating session
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/backlogs/privacy-retention-agents-metadata-deferred.md:37:
