.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/hook-self-failure-budget-unstated.md:1:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/hook-self-failure-budget-unstated.md:2:name: hook-self-failure-budget-unstated
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/hook-self-failure-budget-unstated.md:3:description: PostToolUse hook self-failure budget (flock timeout, error logging) left to executor discretion
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/hook-self-failure-budget-unstated.md:4:type: backlogs
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/install-runtime/backlogs/hook-self-failure-budget-unstated.md:5:scope: feature
