.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:12:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:13:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:14:# Correct the stale `chore` label line citation in `git/conventions.md`
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:15:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:16:## What
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:17:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:18:Update the worktree-first design drafts that cite "`chore | #e4e669` at line 261" in `git/conventions.md` — the `chore` label is actually at line 263 (line 261 holds `fix`). Change every such citation from `git/conventions.md:261` to `git/conventions.md:263`.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:19:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:20:## Why
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:21:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:22:The branch name `chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}` is registry-compliant: the `chore` label exists at line 263 and the type regex at line 22 includes `chore`. The off-by-2 citation is a documentation-accuracy issue only — it affects no runtime behavior. Left uncorrected, the stale citation points a future reader at the wrong line. (Line numbers in `git/conventions.md` can drift over future edits — re-resolve the actual `chore` label line before re-citing it.)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:23:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:24:## Verification
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:25:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:26:After the update, `grep -n "conventions.md:261" <draft>` returns 0 matches, and the `chore` row is confirmed at the cited line (`grep -n 'chore' git/conventions.md`).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:27:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:28:## Status notes
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/checklists/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md:30:Pending — a Low-priority docs-sweep item; pick up during the next docs sweep that touches the worktree-first design drafts. See the sibling backlog `../backlogs/chore-label-line-citation-stale.md` for the deferred-decision context. Surfaced by a consistency-evaluation finding during the worktree-first session-architecture work (session `1b26cf20`, 2026-05-23).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:1:---
