.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:3:description: Scenario where the PostToolUse hook fires but session.json agents[] shows no new entry — operator has no diagnostic to distinguish hook success from silent failure.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:4:type: scenarios
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:5:scope: feature
