.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:7:status: active
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:8:created: 2026-05-23
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:9:session: 1b26cf20-677b-498c-8c1b-7d7e971597ac
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:10:tags: [hook, diagnostics, silent-failure, agents-metadata]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:11:category: failure-mode
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:12:domain: usability
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:13:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:15:# Hook silence — no agents[] mutation visible
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:17:**Category:** failure-mode
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:19:**Coverage:** partial — the reconstructor (`reconstruct-agents.sh`) provides a recovery path, but it requires manual invocation and there is no positive-confirmation diagnostic when the hook runs successfully, so the scenario is only partially handled.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:21:## Situation
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:23:After a Task spawn completes, the PostToolUse hook fires (verified by hook registration), but `session.json.agents[]` has not gained a new entry. The manager or operator cannot tell whether the hook ran and produced no output (e.g., jq parse error, transcript not yet flushed, resolver failed silently) vs the hook did not fire at all.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:25:This scenario is not in the current design's golden-path coverage. The reconstructor (`reconstruct-agents.sh`) provides the recovery path but requires manual invocation; there is no positive-confirmation diagnostic when the hook runs successfully.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:27:## Inputs
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:29:- Completed Task spawn (PostToolUse event fired)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:30:- `session.json.agents[]` unchanged
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:31:- No stderr output visible (hook uses `>/dev/null 2>&1` or similar)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:33:## Expected behavior
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:35:When the hook runs and successfully appends an entry, it SHOULD emit a one-line diagnostic to stderr such as `agents[<id>] appended` (optionally silenceable with a flag). This makes the hook's success visible in the process output without modifying any files.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:37:When the hook fails silently (jq error, resolver failure), it SHOULD exit non-zero with a descriptive error on stderr — the hook's strict-mode design already specifies this failure behavior.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:39:## Verification
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:40:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:41:After Execution: run a Task spawn with hook enabled; check that a diagnostic line appears in the session output or that the reconstructor run confirms the agents[] population.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:42:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:43:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:44:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:45:- The PostToolUse hook script and `reconstruct-agents.sh` reconstructor (the agents[]-metadata mechanism this scenario stresses); the suggested diagnostic line is the design's positive-confirmation gap.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:46:- `claude-code-agent-sdk-task-output` (references/) — the Task-tool output shape the hook reads to populate `session.json.agents[]`.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:47:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:48:## Source
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:49:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/agents/scenarios/hook-silence-no-agents-mutation-diagnostic.md:50:Session 1b26cf20 evaluation — Claude and Codex usage perspectives (two iterations). Suggested fix: add `echo "agents[<id>] appended" >&2` to hook script after successful upsert.
