.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:1:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:2:name: branch-prefix-sub-option
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:3:description: User selected chore/ as the worktree branch type prefix, using the existing registry entry rather than adding a new type.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:6:feature: git-workflow
