.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:10:tags: [git-workflow, branch-naming, worktree-first, type-registry]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:11:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:12:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:13:# Branch type prefix selection — chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:15:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:17:The initial worktree-first design draft used `session/{date}-{ssid-short}` as the worktree branch name. But `session/` is not in the registered branch-type registry (`feat|fix|hotfix|chore|docs|refactor|test|ci|perf|build|style`), so a branch named that way would fail registry validation and block CI/hooks. The branch prefix had to be corrected to a registered type.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:19:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:21:Which branch-type prefix should the worktree branch use, given `session/` is unregistered?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:23:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:25:1. **`chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}`** — reuse the existing `chore` type from the registry; the `session-{date}-{ssid-short}` component satisfies the description-slug regex `[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*`.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:26:2. **`feat/session-{date}-{ssid-short}`** — reuse the existing `feat` type, but `feat` implies a new product feature, not a session-infrastructure branch.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:27:3. **Keep `session/` and add `session` to the branch-type registry** — extends the registry to legitimize the original draft name.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:28:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:29:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:30:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:31:User selected option 1, `chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}` — use the existing `chore` type. `chore` is already registered, the description slug passes validation, and no registry extension is needed; `feat` was rejected because it implies a product feature.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:32:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:33:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:34:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:35:Design Decision D-1 and all branch-naming statements use `chore/session-{date}-{ssid-short}`. The registry-validation failure mode that would have blocked CI/hooks is eliminated.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:36:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:37:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:38:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/branch-prefix-sub-option.md:39:- `design/worktree-create-before-session-stamp.md` — Design Decision D-1, which adopts this branch-naming scheme.
