.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:15:# Gap-resolutions batch confirmation (9 Preparation gaps)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:17:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:19:The Preparation loop identified 9 gaps that required user resolution before Planning could proceed. Each gap received one of three dispositions: skip (no action; rationale documented), generate-now (produce a staged artifact in this loop), or defer-to-backlog (record as a backlog item for a future session).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:21:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:23:For each of the 9 identified gaps: skip, generate-now, or defer-to-backlog?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:25:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:27:Each gap could receive one of three dispositions:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:28:- **Skip** — no action taken this session; the rationale is documented so the gap is not re-raised.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:29:- **Generate-now** — produce a staged artifact (decision or design file) in this loop to close the gap immediately.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:30:- **Defer-to-backlog** — record a backlog item for a future session when a witness or precondition (e.g., N≥2 scripts) materializes.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:32:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:34:- **Gap 1 (feature dir pre-create)**: Skip. Wrap-up bootstraps feature dirs.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:35:- **Gap 2 (hooks-domain mistakes)**: Defer to backlog. No witnesses yet; capture mid-Execution.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:36:- **Gap 3 (Planning brief mistake citations)**: Generate-now. Bind Planning to cite 3 specific mistakes in every task brief's Load Directives.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:37:- **Gap 4 (workflow phase doc set)**: Generate-now. Stage the 5-file enumeration as a design file.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:38:- **Gap 5 (`.claude/scripts/` dir)**: Skip. Executor handles `mkdir -p` at implementation time.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:39:- **Gap 6 (session-lifecycle design doc)**: Defer to backlog. Post-Execution follow-up.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:40:- **Gap 7 (`gobbi-hook-authoring` skill)**: Defer to backlog. Pick up when hook scripts reach N≥2.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:41:- **Gap 8 (separate `gobbi-session-architecture` skill)**: Skip. The Execution task edits ARE the codification.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:42:- **Gap 9 (`gobbi-shell-script-conventions` skill)**: Skip. Re-evaluate at N≥2 scripts.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:43:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:44:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:45:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:46:Two generate-now artifacts produced: `decisions/` (planning brief mistake-citation rule) and `design/workflow-phase-doc-set-for-per-iter-cadence.md` (5-file enumeration). Three backlog items staged. Four gaps closed with rationale only.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:47:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/gap-resolutions-9-batch.md:48:## Related
