.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:14:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:15:# Direct-mode opt-out doc home
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:16:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:17:## Context
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:18:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:19:The worktree-first design (Design Decision D-5) preserves direct mode as a documented escape hatch: if `settings.git.workflow.mode = 'direct'`, the worktree creation step is skipped and `worktreePath` remains null. The question was where to document this opt-out path.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:20:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:21:## Question
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:22:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:23:Where should the direct-mode opt-out be documented?
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:24:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:25:## Options considered
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:26:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:27:1. **orchestration/SKILL.md worktree-creation footnote** (recommended) — co-locates the opt-out with the exact step it opts out of.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:28:2. **git/SKILL.md workflow-mode docs** — alongside the general git workflow-mode documentation. Creates cross-skill indirection; an executor reading the orchestration step would need to cross-reference git/SKILL.md to find the opt-out.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:29:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:30:## User decision
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:31:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:32:`orchestration/SKILL.md` worktree-creation footnote confirmed.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:33:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:34:## Opt-out text
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:35:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:36:"If `settings.git.workflow.mode = 'direct'`, the worktree creation step is skipped and `worktreePath` remains null."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:37:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:38:Co-located with the smoke-test gate: `jq '.git.branch' session.json` must match `^chore/session-[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[a-f0-9]{8}$` when worktree mode is active.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:39:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:40:## Implication
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:41:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:42:The Execution task implementing the direct-mode opt-out owns both the footnote and the smoke-test gate. The file home is `orchestration/SKILL.md` at the worktree-creation step. `git/SKILL.md` gets the general critical-rule qualifier (worktreePath resolution) but NOT the direct-mode opt-out documentation.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:43:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:44:## Related
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:45:
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:46:- `design/direct-mode-retained-opt-out.md` — Design Decision D-5, the direct-mode opt-out this discussion places.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/2026-05-24-direct-mode-opt-out-doc-home.md:47:- `design/worktree-create-before-session-stamp.md` — the worktree-creation step (D-1) whose footnote holds the opt-out text.
