.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/worktree-create-before-session-stamp.md:3:description: Worktree creation and git.worktreePath stamping happen in the Configuration step before session.json stamps git fields.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/worktree-create-before-session-stamp.md:4:type: design
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/worktree-create-before-session-stamp.md:5:scope: feature
