.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/per-iteration-session-commit-cadence.md:1:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/per-iteration-session-commit-cadence.md:2:name: per-iteration-session-commit-cadence
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/per-iteration-session-commit-cadence.md:3:description: Each loop's MEMORIZATION step ends with a worktree-branch commit using chore(session) subject format, once per iteration.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/per-iteration-session-commit-cadence.md:4:type: design
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/design/per-iteration-session-commit-cadence.md:5:scope: feature
