.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:1:---
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:2:name: worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:3:description: User locked worktree-first over two-surface and symlink-into-worktree alternatives; alternatives deferred to backlog.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:4:type: discussions
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:5:scope: feature
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/discussions/worktree-first-vs-collapsing-strategies.md:6:feature: git-workflow
