.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/worktree-scope-by-module-not-task.md:10:tags: [worktree, scope, commit-discipline, session-isolation]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/worktree-scope-by-module-not-task.md:11:title: Worktree scope-by-module rule + commit-at-session-boundaries discipline
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/worktree-scope-by-module-not-task.md:12:source: https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/parallel-agentic-development-claude-code-worktrees
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/worktree-scope-by-module-not-task.md:13:accessed: 2026-05-23
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/worktree-scope-by-module-not-task.md:14:ref_type: blog
