.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/claude-jj-worktree-shim-pattern.md:10:tags: [worktree, plugin, shim, claude-code, jj]
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/claude-jj-worktree-shim-pattern.md:11:title: claude-jj-worktree shim — interception pattern for worktree subcommands
