.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/claude-code-worktree-isolation-pattern.md:11:title: Claude Code official worktree-isolation pattern (parallel sessions)
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/claude-code-worktree-isolation-pattern.md:12:source: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/git-workflow/references/claude-code-worktree-isolation-pattern.md:13:accessed: 2026-05-23
